@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home Page";
}

<style>
    * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    
    body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333;
    }
    
    .homepage-container {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 40px 20px;
    }
    
    .hero-section {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 80px 40px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        color: white;
        border-radius: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 60px;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.3);
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }
    
    .hero-section::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: -50%;
        right: -50%;
        width: 200%;
        height: 200%;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
        animation: pulse 15s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    
    @@keyframes pulse {
        0%, 100% { transform: scale(1) rotate(0deg); opacity: 0.5; }
        50% { transform: scale(1.1) rotate(180deg); opacity: 0.8; }
    }
    
    .hero-section h1 {
        font-size: 3.5em;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 3px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        text-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    }
    
    .subtitle {
        font-size: 1.4em;
        font-weight: 300;
        opacity: 0.95;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    
    .content-section {
        padding: 0 20px;
    }
    
    .intro-text {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 60px;
        animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out;
    }
    
    @@keyframes fadeInUp {
        from {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(30px);
        }
        to {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }
    }
    
    .intro-text p {
        font-size: 1.2em;
        line-height: 2;
        color: #555;
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }
    
    .features {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
        gap: 30px;
        margin-bottom: 60px;
    }
    
    .feature-box {
        padding: 40px 30px;
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 16px;
        border: none;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }
    
    .feature-box::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 4px;
        height: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        transition: height 0.3s ease;
    }
    
    .feature-box:hover {
        transform: translateY(-10px);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.2);
    }
    
    .feature-box:hover::before {
        height: 100%;
    }
    
    .feature-box h3 {
        color: #2c3e50;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        font-size: 1.5em;
        font-weight: 600;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
    }
    
    .feature-box p {
        color: #6c757d;
        line-height: 1.8;
        font-size: 1.05em;
    }
    
    .closing-text {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 50px 40px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa 0%, #e9ecef 100%);
        border-radius: 16px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }
    
    .closing-text::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        height: 4px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
    }
    
    .closing-text p {
        font-size: 1.15em;
        line-height: 2;
        color: #555;
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
    }
    
    @@media (max-width: 768px) {
        .hero-section {
            padding: 60px 30px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        
        .hero-section h1 {
            font-size: 2.2em;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        
        .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.1em;
        }
        
        .features {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        
        .intro-text p,
        .closing-text p {
            font-size: 1.05em;
        }
        
        .feature-box {
            padding: 30px 20px;
        }
        
        .closing-text {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }
    }
    
    @@media (max-width: 480px) {
        .homepage-container {
            padding: 20px 15px;
        }
        
        .hero-section h1 {
            font-size: 1.8em;
        }
    }
</style>

<div class="homepage-container">
    <div class="hero-section">
        <h1>Eleganza Senza Tempo</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">La tua destinazione per l'abbigliamento raffinato</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content-section">
        <div class="intro-text">
            <p>
                Benvenuto nel nostro mondo di stile ed eleganza. Qui troverai una selezione curata
                di capi che incarnano la qualità e il design italiano. Dalle camicie sartoriali alle
                polo classiche, ogni pezzo è scelto per valorizzare il tuo guardaroba.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="features">
            <div class="feature-box">
                <h3>Qualità Superiore</h3>
                <p>Tessuti pregiati e lavorazioni artigianali per capi che durano nel tempo.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-box">
                <h3>Stile Raffinato</h3>
                <p>Un'attenta selezione di modelli classici e contemporanei per ogni occasione.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-box">
                <h3>Vestibilità Perfetta</h3>
                <p>Taglie pensate per garantire comfort e una silhouette impeccabile.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="closing-text">
            <p>
                Ogni capo racconta una storia di passione per il dettaglio e amore per la moda autentica.
                Che tu stia cercando l'outfit perfetto per un evento importante o desideri rinnovare
                il tuo stile quotidiano, qui troverai ciò che fa per te.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>